authors:
  - given-names: "Toshinee"
    family-names: "Bhasin"
    affiliation: "P.E.S. Modern College of Engineering, Pune, Maharashtra, India"

abstract: >
  SpringLLM-Bench is a framework-aware benchmark and evaluation suite for
  assessing security, reliability, build success, startup behavior, and
  functional correctness in LLM-generated Spring Boot applications.
  The pilot artifact contains five enterprise-oriented benchmark tasks,
  three evaluated LLMs, three generations per model-task cell, and
  45 frozen generated applications.

